              <svg style="width:1.5rem;height:1.5rem;color:#fff;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:#111;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Redução de Custos Operacionais</h3>
