            </div>
            <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:#111;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Sustentabilidade Corporativa</h3>
            <p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.7;">Reduza a pegada de carbono e fortaleça a imagem da marca com compromisso ambiental.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card benefit-card" style="padding:2rem;">
            <div class="benefit-icon" style="width:3.5rem;height:3.5rem;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FE5C17,#FF8F00);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">
              <svg style="width:1.5rem;height:1.5rem;color:#fff;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:#111;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Energia Previsível</h3>
            <p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.7;">Proteja-se contra reajustes tarifários e tenha previsibilidade nos custos de energia.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card benefit-card" style="padding:2rem;">
            <div class="benefit-icon" style="width:3.5rem;height:3.5rem;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FE5C17,#FF8F00);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">
              <svg style="width:1.5rem;height:1.5rem;color:#fff;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:#111;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Valorização do Imóvel</h3>
            <p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.7;">Imóveis com sistema solar instalado têm maior valor de mercado e atratividade.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card benefit-card" style="padding:2rem;">
            <div class="benefit-icon" style="width:3.5rem;height:3.5rem;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FE5C17,#FF8F00);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">
              <svg style="width:1.5rem;height:1.5rem;color:#fff;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"/></svg>
